# Frequency conversion between gigahertz and terahertz

Verifies direct conversion between gigahertz and terahertz in both directions. Gigahertz converts to the coarser unit through decimal promotion, while terahertz converts to gigahertz with an integer scale.

>>> source
const forward_whole: int = 1ghz
print(forward_whole->to(thz))
const forward_fractional: decimal = 1.5ghz
print(forward_fractional->to(thz))
const backward_whole: int = 1thz
print(backward_whole->to(ghz))
const backward_fractional: decimal = 1.5thz
print(backward_fractional->to(ghz))

<<< stdout
0.001thz
0.0015thz
1000ghz
1500.0ghz

<<< stderr
